  "description": "In-place words of BUNKASAI.EXN and BUNKAKEN.EXN (the festival overlays): the club menu, girl names, exhibit names, the PC fortune screen's labels; plus one nop per overlay so the PC fortune doesn't draw the girl's given name twice (game-internals 6ab). Verified in DuckStation on forced festival days (tools/emu/force_festival.py, hidden emulator; docs/testing.md 'The culture festival'): the club menu, the girl menu, the PC fortune screens with Shiori, Ayako and Yuina. Layout and flow in game-internals 6ab. The stage shows (Drama play, Band concert, Literature speech contest) are BUNKA_SD.EXN, still Japanese. Natural triggers, other years and moods checked only statically.",
